      "writtenOn": "2017-06-20T02:37:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah I think it makes sense. Basically if BBRAM gets corrupt for any reason, then print out an error and reset IBBR. That way BBRAM would be functional again without need of an EC reset.",
